## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical use of WorkManager for reliable background sync, Room transactions, and idempotent updates. It also covers testing offline→online flows and error handling in a beginner-friendly way.

## Key Concepts

- WorkManager with network constraints and backoff
- Room data modeling and transactional updates
- Idempotent client-side retries and serverId mapping
- Testing offline→online scenarios with mock servers

